"Could not install Udev rule for profile {profile_id}. DBus Service "
"'{dbus_interface}' wasn't available"
msgstr ""
"Neuspešno instaliranje Udev pravila za profil {profile_id}. DBus Service "
"'{dbus_interface}' nije dostupan"

